==Game data==
===NPC appearances===
*If the player chose {{p|Charmander}}, the player's [[rival]], {{ga|Blue}}, will pick Squirtle in [[Generation I]] and {{g|FireRed and LeafGreen}}. Blue will use this Squirtle in his first three battles against the player before it evolves into {{p|Wartortle}}.
*[[Professor Sycamore]] will use a Squirtle in his first battle against the player in {{g|X and Y}}.
*{{g|Pokopia}}: Squirtle is the very first Pokémon that can be befriended. When found laying on the ground and in need of hydration, {{poko|Ditto}} learns {{m|Water Gun}} and uses it on Squirtle to help them.

