In ''[[M01|Mewtwo Strikes Back]]'', a Squirtle was cloned from Ash's Squirtle. It then participated in the battle between the original Pokémon and the cloned Pokémon. Squirtle reappeared in ''[[Mewtwo Returns]]''.

